  ('0a897e30-5143-5371-abd5-bb5b2119f478', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'modifier-placement'), null, 'medium',
   $q$Read the sentence: "Hiking up the steep trail, Marisol's backpack felt heavier with every step." Which word is the opening phrase actually attached to?$q$, $q$[{"text":"backpack","is_correct":true},{"text":"Marisol","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"possessive-as-subject"},{"text":"trail","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"object-of-phrase"},{"text":"step","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"nearest-noun-at-end"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$backpack$q$, $q$The subject of the sentence is "backpack"; "Marisol's" only tells whose backpack it is. So the sentence says the backpack was hiking, which is why it needs to be rewritten with Marisol as the subject.$q$, 'draft', null)
